  "question_stem": "A block $B$ of mass $4$ kg is pushed up a line of greatest slope of a smooth plane inclined at $30^{\\circ}$ to the horizontal by a force applied to $B$, acting in the direction of motion of $B$. The block passes through points $P$ and $Q$ with speeds $12 \\text{ m s}^{-1}$ and $8 \\text{ m s}^{-1}$ respectively. $P$ and $Q$ are $10$ m apart with $P$ below the level of $Q$.",
